#!/usr/bin/env python3
# Some portions generated by Codex.
import pathlib,json
p=pathlib.Path(__file__).resolve().parent;arms=['base','depth','serializer','both'];ss={a:json.loads((p/'runs'/('profile-'+a)/'profile-summary.json').read_text()) for a in arms}
o=['# Typed compact-row serializer: separate HTTP profiles','','Four fresh diagnostic JVMs after clean timings,60warmups then30recorded requests each. All360 requests passed witnesses. Full128-frame recording/export; all Java server/Workbench threads analyzed, Node CPU absent. Setup/metrics between requests are inside recording. No durations pooled into clean timings.','','Nearest work categories are exclusive by matching frame; TLS visibility overlaps them and must not be added. Samples are not exact invocations or wall-time shares. One profile per arm cannot prove a stable difference.','','| Arm | Java samples | NDJSON nearest | TLS-visible | verifyValueWrite leaf | Sampled allocation weight GB |','|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|']
for a,s in ss.items():
 leaf=dict(s['topLeaves']).get('tools.jackson.core.json.UTF8JsonGenerator._verifyValueWrite',0);o.append(f"| {a} | {s['javaSamples']} | {s['nearestCategories'].get('workbench_ndjson',0)} | {s['threadLocalVisibleSamples']} | {leaf} | {s['sampledAllocationWeight']/1e9:.2f} |")
o+=['','## Actual JSON call stacks','','Below are the highest retained top stacks involving JSON for each arm. The top-stack summary truncates the overall ranked list, so absence from this list is not proof of zero invocations.','']
for a,s in ss.items():
 o+=['### '+a,'']
 hits=[(k,n) for k,n in s['topStacks'] if 'Json' in k or 'CompactRows.write' in k]
 for k,n in hits[:3]:o.append(f'- {n} samples: `{k}`.')
 o.append('')
o+=['## Interpretation','','The typed path preserves packed objects and creates a fresh generator; it changes dispatch only. Expected source-level effect is bypassing generic String/ObjectArray/IndexedList serializers and ObjectMapper configuration for compact row payloads, while JSON state checks, escaping, packed-term construction, buffering and record flushes remain. Disappearing generic frames therefore do not mean all serialization overhead disappeared.','','Clean primary completion latency improved8.11% on depth, but serializer-alone and combined-versus-base superiority remain inconclusive and first-row latency worsened in the serializer-alone comparison. Profiles cannot explain that first-row tradeoff causally or convert the inconclusive interaction into proven synergy. Keep the independently measured mixed outcome.','','Sampled allocation class weights are highly variable, include setup/metrics, and are neither exact allocated bytes nor retained heap. No GC or generator-allocation saving is established by these profiles. Any generator reuse or elimination of packed term objects would be a separate correctness-sensitive candidate, not part of the tested patch. No additional clean round or automatic candidate adoption follows.','','## Remaining nearest work categories','']
for a,s in ss.items():o+=['### '+a,'',json.dumps(s['nearestCategories'],sort_keys=True),'']
text='\n'.join(o).replace('JVMs after clean timings,60warmups then30recorded','JVMs after clean timings, 60 warmups then 30 recorded').replace('All360','All 360').replace('Full128-frame','Full 128-frame').replace('improved8.11%','improved 8.11%');(p/'HTTP-PROFILES.md').write_text(text)
with (p/'HTTP-PROFILES.md').open('a') as f:
 f.write('\n## Observed dispatch shift\n\nNDJSON-nearest samples were 153/1001 (base), 128/898 (depth), 82/866 (serializer), and 81/829 (both). The verifyValueWrite leaf had 114/95/14/14 samples. Base/depth top stacks use generic StringSerializer, ObjectArraySerializer and IndexedListSerializer; serializer/both top stacks instead use WorkbenchPageResultWriter.writePackedValue/writePackedRow, with String.charAt/string escaping visible. This verifies the intended actual-path dispatch change. It does not imply value-state checks were removed: inlining and changed sampling denominators can alter leaf visibility. The sampled contrast supports a mechanism, not an exact attribution of the clean latency gain.\n')
